WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,330 --> 00:00:03,330
Why would dad find a stepmother for the fish?

2
00:00:03,330 --> 00:00:06,710
That person just now was really my father’s former classmate

3
00:00:06,710 --> 00:00:07,710
Of course it's true

4
00:00:07,710 --> 00:00:11,060
Then forgive Dad reluctantly

5
00:00:11,060 --> 00:00:13,060
A fish has only one mother

6
00:00:13,060 --> 00:00:14,060
No stepmother

7
00:00:14,060 --> 00:00:17,700
yes yes yes

8
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:19,700
How about dad taking you out shopping?

9
00:00:19,700 --> 00:00:20,700
What to buy?

10
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:24,110
Of course I’m buying a bed for our fish princess.

11
00:00:24,110 --> 00:00:26,210
The fish is already a big child

12
00:00:26,210 --> 00:00:29,210
I really need to start learning to sleep on my own bed
